# Auth

- NextAuth config: `lib/auth/auth.ts` + `auth.config.ts`; route handlers under `app/api/auth/[...nextauth]`.
- Session strategy is **JWT**. Extend types via `types/next-auth.d.ts`.
- Protect pages with middleware matcher (`/dashboard/:path*`) and `requireAuth()` in server code.
- Credentials: bcrypt hash compare only; never log passwords or `passwordHash`.
- Auth forms validate with `lib/validations/auth.ts`.
- New protected top-level routes must be added to `middleware.ts` `matcher` if outside `/dashboard`.
